    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Watch and fetch\nThe Drive Trigger fires on new files in the Inbox folder. Configuration holds the destination folder, log Sheet, Slack channel, and the three size bands. Download File puts the PDF on `data`; non-PDFs stop at Is PDF?.",
        "width": 760,
        "height": 160,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "a657120f-9ab2-4dca-ad20-1a8c57a34e00",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Inspect and describe\nQuery PDF Info returns page count as JSON; the Merge reattaches the PDF. Convert PDF to Markdown feeds a Basic LLM Chain that writes a one-line description; a second Merge reattaches the PDF again. Measure and Choose Level then converts the reported size to bytes and picks skip / low / medium / high from the bands.",
        "width": 1200,
        "height": 160,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "9925b0da-68f1-45e6-8a7d-085da55b6c4a",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        920,
        -340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. Compress or skip\nFiles above the threshold go through Optimize \u00b7 Compress PDF and Measure Result computes the savings; the optimized copy is uploaded. Files below it are recorded as skipped with the original link.",
        "width": 1000,
        "height": 160,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "363a5416-66fd-435b-83d4-5b3635361619",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2600,
        -380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 4. Log and notify\nOne Sheets row and one Slack line per file, compressed or skipped, so the log is a complete history of the folder.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 140,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "d453fa75-15f7-40a7-915c-411c411b67c5",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3560,
        -260
      ]
